# SOC2 Type II continuous-evidencing case study (v26.7.13 Stage 3) --
# ADVERSARIAL fixture: a control point (CTRL-UNREMEDIABLE, fictional) whose
# evidence gap has NO real corrective action reachable from its declared
# initial state. `remediation-evidence-available` is never asserted by
# :init and no action in this domain produces it, so
# `apply-remediation-ctrl-unremediable`'s precondition can never hold.
#
# This fixture exists ONLY to prove the COMPLIANCE-OVERCLAIM FENCE's typed-
# refusal discipline: "any control point that cannot be genuinely
# evidenced must refuse typed (never silently pass, never fabricate
# evidence)". `pddl_index::solve_indexed` must find no plan here, so F09's
# `plan_growth` refuses `MFWGrowthRefused::GoalUnreachable` -- never a
# silently-fabricated `remediation-applied` fact. Not part of
# `OE_TESTING_GROWTH_CYCLE`'s 6 real descents; used by its own standalone
# adversarial test.
@prefix ceng:    <urn:chatman:engine#> .
@prefix skos:    <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

_:artifact
    skos:notation "OE-TESTING-GROWTH-UNREMEDIABLE-EXCEPTION" ;
    dcterms:description "Adversarial fixture: CTRL-UNREMEDIABLE has an identified exception with no reachable remediation action; the continuation goal must be typed-refused, never fabricated closed."@en ;
    ceng:pddlDomain """
(define (domain arclight-soc2-oe-unremediable-exception)
  (:requirements :strips)
  (:predicates
    (exception-identified-ctrl-unremediable ?x)
    (remediation-evidence-available ?x)
    (remediation-applied-ctrl-unremediable ?x))
  (:action apply-remediation-ctrl-unremediable
    :parameters (?x)
    :precondition (and (remediation-evidence-available ?x))
    :effect (and (remediation-applied-ctrl-unremediable ?x))))
""" ;
    ceng:pddlProblem """
(define (problem arclight-soc2-oe-unremediable-exception-p)
  (:domain arclight-soc2-oe-unremediable-exception)
  (:objects arclight)
  (:init (exception-identified-ctrl-unremediable arclight))
  (:goal (and (remediation-applied-ctrl-unremediable arclight))))
""" .
